# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Or: <type>: <subject> when scope adds no useful context.
#
# Optional body (blank line above required): explain the *what* and *why*
#
# Types: feat · fix · docs · style · refactor · perf · test · chore
# Scope: optional – module or component (e.g. api, cli)
# Scope chars: lowercase letters, digits, ., _, -, /
# Lines: keep each commit message line at 100 chars or fewer
# Subject: imperative, lowercase first letter, no trailing period
# Revert: revert: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
